技的秘密基地，占据世界经济命脉三分之一的经济群竟一夕间倾塌，灰飞烟灭。群岛上空轰鸣声炸响，飞机内却死寂一片。凰冷月绝美的嘴角邪肆的勾起，“害我？我灭你全族！”那从容淡定的模样，伴着与生俱来的高贵冷艳。酒红色短发妖冶，慵懒的眸透着丝丝嗜杀。她，凰冷月，二十一世纪名冠天下的冷血杀手，现稳坐全球第一黑暗组织“尊凰”的首席交椅，纵横黑白两道。几乎掌握了大半个世界的经济命脉。外界对她的评价只有八个字：只手遮天，权倾世界。手段狠毒，狠戾决绝。她有一条信仰，宁我负天下人，莫叫天下人负我！“冷月，没想到我还活着吧？”身后传来一道冰冷的声音。凰冷月猛地转过头，刚才还站在身后不远处的属下们早就一个个倒地，鲜血开始慢慢浸透地毯。她面对的正是刚才应该被轰炸成灰的隐世家族的少当家，那个曾经口口声声说爱她，却负了她的男人——夜御天。夜御天负手而立，傲然的身姿依然挺秀，棱角分明脸上带着却风华绝代的笑：“冷月，就算你摧毁全世界，我在你体内种下的超级病毒也不能消除，除非……你给我尊皇地库的密码。”他将密码两个字咬得很重。原来是为了密码！她“尊凰”打拼下来的绝大部分财富都封存在地库中。原来她这么容易就把他夜家的老巢炸毁，是他先设计好的。只要他得到了尊凰的地库密码，再卷土重来又有什么难度？痛……霎时席卷着神经，但是心痛过后，凰冷月忽然感觉自己可笑。沉静，帅气，邪气，桀骜不驯，这个曾经被她认定是同类，她曾爱的死去活来的男人，却在查明他来历的时候在她内心深处狠狠刺了一刀。这一刀，是她永生难忘的痛。他所做的一切，包括让自己无可救药的爱上他，只是想得到自己那足足够世界一半国家的财富，还有地库中封存的尊皇研究出来的超级病毒武器。“御天，你就这么想要得到地库密码？”她勾唇一笑，那笑容是风华绝代的美。夜御天被她的笑容迷得一愣。可是下一刻，风来，夜御天一凛。几乎是不可能。顷刻间，凰冷月已然飘至他面前，纤细有力指尖深深刺入他的喉间。一招绝顶的锁拿术令夜御天不敢轻举妄动。她猛地捏紧，那冰冷的眸底刺得的夜御天不敢直视：“夜御天，你确定你能拿到密码？”夜御天笑了，那从容而邪气的笑那么熟悉：“冷月，你还是爱我的！只要你乖乖合作，我们还是可以在一起的。”呵呵。凰冷月失笑。拿着致命病毒逼着她交出财富的男人竟然还有脸说她和他还可以在一起？", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 Zunhuang Lengyue 2014, summer, center of the Nordic Islands. \"Fire!\" A capable female voice boomed out of thin air. boom! The world was momentarily out of balance, dust was rising, and tens of thousands of villas on the islands began to collapse. Amidst the flames in the sky, a dark plane flew northward silently. The secret base that gathers the world's cutting-edge biotechnology, and the economic group that accounts for one-third of the world's economic lifeline, collapsed overnight and was wiped out. There was a roar over the islands, but there was dead silence inside the plane. The corners of Huang Lengyue's beautiful mouth curled up wickedly, \"Harm me? I will destroy your entire clan!\" That calm and calm look was accompanied by an innate nobility and coolness. She has short burgundy hair and is flirtatious, and her lazy eyes reveal a hint of bloodlust. She, Huang Lengyue, is the most famous cold-blooded killer in the world in the 21st century. She is now firmly seated at the top of the world's number one dark organization, \"Zunhuang\", and is involved in both black and white. It almost controls the economic lifeblood of most of the world. The outside world has only eight words to describe her: she covers the sky with one hand and has power over the world. The methods are vicious and ruthless. She has a belief that I would rather betray the world than let the world betray me! \"Leng Yue, you didn't expect me to be alive, did you?\" A cold voice came from behind. Huang Lengyue turned her head sharply. The subordinates who were standing not far behind her had already fallen to the ground one by one, and their blood began to slowly soak into the carpet. She was facing the young head of the hidden family who should have been bombed to ashes just now, the man who once said he loved her but failed her - Ye Yutian. Ye Yutian stood with his hands behind his hands, his proud figure still tall and graceful, and his angular face with a smile that was unparalleled: \"Leng Yue, even if you destroy the whole world, the super virus I planted in your body cannot be eliminated unless...you give me the password to the Zunhuang vault.\" He bit the word password hard. It turns out it’s for the password! Most of the wealth she earned through her \"Zunhuang\" efforts is sealed in the basement. It turned out that he had designed it first for her to blow up his Ye family's lair so easily. As long as he gets Zunhuang's vault password, how difficult will it be to make a comeback? The pain... swept through her nerves instantly, but after the heartache, Huang Lengyue suddenly felt ridiculous. Calm, handsome, evil, and unruly, this man whom she once considered to be of the same kind and whom she once loved stabbed her deeply in her heart when she found out his origins. This knife was a pain she would never forget. Everything he did, including letting himself fall hopelessly in love with him, was just to get his wealth, which is enough for half the countries in the world, and the super virus weapon developed by Zun Huang that was sealed in the vault. \"Yutian, do you really want to get the password to the basement?\" She curled her lips and smiled, and that smile was extremely beautiful. Ye Yutian was stunned by her smile. But the next moment, the wind came, and the night sky became cold. Almost impossible. In an instant, Huang Lengyue floated in front of him, and her slender and powerful fingertips penetrated deeply into his throat. A superb locking technique made Ye Yutian dare not act rashly. She squeezed tightly, and Ye Yutian dared not look directly at her with those cold eyes: \"Ye Yutian, are you sure you can get the password?\" Ye Yutian smiled, that calm and evil smile so familiar: \"Leng Yue, you still love me! As long as you cooperate well, we can still be together.\" Haha. Huang Lengyue laughed. The man who forced her to hand over her wealth with a deadly virus still had the nerve to say that she and him could still be together?", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}